{
 "uid": "gateway-slo",
 "title": "Gateway SLO: availability and latency",
 "description": "Availability = share of app requests (routes sample-app_*) that are not 5xx. Edit the targets in the variables above. Burn rate 1 = spending the error budget exactly on schedule; >14 on 1h = page-worthy. Data before 2026-10-26 19:06 UTC used hash route ids and is not counted. Generated by observability/dashboards/build.py; edit there, not in the UI.",
 "tags": [
  "apisix",
  "slo"
 ],
